    skos:prefLabel "1 September"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-1-8 ;
    values:originalText "No. 13, 2021 Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021 Commencement information Column 1 Column 2 Column 3 Provisions Commencement Date/Details (a) at the same time as the commencement of the provisions covered by table item 2; and (b) immediately after the commencement of Schedule 2 to the Aged Care Legislation Amendment (New Commissioner Functions) Act 2019. However, the provisions do not commence at all if the event mentioned in paragraph (b) does not occur. (paragraph (a) applies)" ;
