    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Leave of the Supreme Court of a State or Territory is required to appeal to the Court from a decree of a court of summary jurisdiction of that State or Territory exercising jurisdiction under: (a) the Child Support (Assessment) Act 1989; or (b) the Child Support (Registration and Collection) Act 1988." ;
    cof:pageNumber "30"^^xsd:integer .

concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-1-sec-47b-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "47B(3) Leave to appeal needed for child support matters"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-47b-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) An application for leave to appeal must be made within: (a) in the case of leave of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1): (i) the time prescribed by the Federal Circuit and Family Court (Division 1) Rules; or (ii) such further time as is allowed in accordance with those Rules; and  Amendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia  Schedule 1 Amendments  Part 1 No. 13, 2021 Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021 (b) in any other case: (i) the time prescribed by the standard Rules of Court; or (ii) such further time as is allowed in accordance with those Rules." ;
    skos:definition "(3) An application for leave to appeal must be made within: (a) in the case of leave of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1): (i) the time prescribed by the Federal Circuit and Family Court (Division 1) Rules; or (ii) such further time as is allowed in accordance with those Rules; and  Amendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia  Schedule 1 Amendments  Part 1 No. 13, 2021 Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021 (b) in any other case: (i) the time prescribed by the standard Rules of Court; or (ii) such further time as is allowed in accordance with those Rules."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ac422eeedb3da7fcde0e8a910826dffca8050d254dbfd0e125cba56372c16737" ;
    values:partOf concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-1-sec-47b ;
