concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-1-sec-47b-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "47B(4) Leave to appeal needed for child support matters"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-47b-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The applicable Rules of Court may make provision for enabling applications for leave to be dealt with, subject to conditions prescribed by the Rules, without an oral hearing." ;
    skos:definition "(4) The applicable Rules of Court may make provision for enabling applications for leave to be dealt with, subject to conditions prescribed by the Rules, without an oral hearing."@en ;
