    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) Section 109A has no effect in relation to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1) except as provided by subsections (1) and (2) of this section." ;
    cof:pageNumber "41"^^xsd:integer .

