    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute: (b) the Chief Executive Officer; and  Amendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia  Schedule 1 Amendments  Part 1 No. 13, 2021 Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021 (ba) a Senior Registrar or Registrar of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1); and (bb) a Senior Registrar or Registrar of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2); and" ;
