concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-1-sec-18pa a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "18PA Marshal"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-18pa ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Marshal of the Court is responsible for: (a) the security of the Court; and  Amendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia  Schedule 1 Amendments  Part 1 No. 13, 2021 Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021 (b) the personal security of the Judges and officers and staff of the Court. (2) The Marshal of the Court is also responsible for: (a) taking, receiving and detaining all persons committed to the Marshal’s custody by the Court; and (b) discharging such persons when so directed by the Court or otherwise required by law." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Marshal of the Court is responsible for: (a) the security of the Court; and  Amendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia  Schedule 1 Amendments  Part 1 No. 13, 2021 Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021 (b) the personal security of the Judges and officers and staff of the Court. (2) The Marshal of the Court is also responsible for: (a) taking, receiving and detaining all persons committed to the Marshal’s custody by the Court; and (b) discharging such persons when so directed by the Court or otherwise required by law."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e44b23c341a06bd13c64eac69d265b2e7cc22a6d5b8e1765b4911c7607a227d9" ;
    cof:pageNumber "50"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-1-sec-18pa-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-1-sec-18pa-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <c2021a00013rec01.pdf> ;
    dc:source "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.50" .
