    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraphs, substitute: (b) the officers of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1) referred to in paragraphs 103(1)(a) to (e) of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021; (c) the officers of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) referred to in paragraphs 259(1)(a) to  Amendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia  Schedule 1 Amendments  Part 1 No. 13, 2021 Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021 (g) of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021;" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraphs, substitute: (b) the officers of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1) referred to in paragraphs 103(1)(a) to (e) of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021; (c) the officers of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) referred to in paragraphs 259(1)(a) to  Amendments relating to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia  Schedule 1 Amendments  Part 1 No. 13, 2021 Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021 (g) of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021;"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b6db45ea0c6212fbe45f951f975340d7de55ff4ac32d4144003e9ee5b5f4b0d5" ;
