doc:sch-1-sec-32ad-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "32AD(2) Confirmation of civil proceedings transferred from the" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Court may, in its discretion, receive further evidence to decide whether to make an order under subsection (1). Such evidence may be taken in any of the ways mentioned in section 27." ;
    cof:pageNumber "62"^^xsd:integer .

concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-1-sec-32ad-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32AD(3) Confirmation of civil proceedings transferred from the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-32ad-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Court has jurisdiction in a matter that: (a) is the subject of a proceeding transferred to the Court by the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2); and (b) is a matter in which the Court does not have jurisdiction apart from this subsection. To avoid doubt, the Court’s jurisdiction under this subsection is not subject to limits set by another provision." ;
    skos:definition "(3) The Court has jurisdiction in a matter that: (a) is the subject of a proceeding transferred to the Court by the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2); and (b) is a matter in which the Court does not have jurisdiction apart from this subsection. To avoid doubt, the Court’s jurisdiction under this subsection is not subject to limits set by another provision."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fed5dad9e04c050f651f7452253a2cb0f07147909e02448d2d958423b6232e4f" ;
