concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-1-sec-32ad-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "32AD(4) Confirmation of civil proceedings transferred from the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-32ad-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) An appeal does not lie from a decision of the Court in relation to an order made under subsection (1) confirming the transfer of a proceeding." ;
    skos:definition "(4) An appeal does not lie from a decision of the Court in relation to an order made under subsection (1) confirming the transfer of a proceeding."@en ;
