concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-1-sec-230 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "230 Authorisation about handling complaints"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-230 ;
    values:originalText "A written authorisation made under subsection 21B(3A) of the Family Law Act 1975 and in force immediately before the commencement day continues in force (and may be dealt with) as if it had been made under subsection 48(2) of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021." ;
    skos:definition "A written authorisation made under subsection 21B(3A) of the Family Law Act 1975 and in force immediately before the commencement day continues in force (and may be dealt with) as if it had been made under subsection 48(2) of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021."@en ;
