concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-130 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "130 Subsection 35A(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-130 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute: (1) If a proceeding is pending in the Federal Court, the Federal Court may, on the application of a party to the proceeding or of its own motion, transfer the proceeding to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1)." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute: (1) If a proceeding is pending in the Federal Court, the Federal Court may, on the application of a party to the proceeding or of its own motion, transfer the proceeding to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1)."@en ;
