concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-107-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "107 Appeals to High Court"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-107-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) An appeal must not be brought directly to the High Court from a decree of a court exercising original jurisdiction under this Act (other than the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia). Note: In relation to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia, see sections 55 and 155 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021. (2) If, apart from this subsection, subsection (1) is to any extent inconsistent with section 73 of the Constitution, this Act has effect  Schedule 2  Further consequential amendments  Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021 No. 13, 2021 as if the words “, except by special leave of the High Court” were added at the end of subsection (1)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) An appeal must not be brought directly to the High Court from a decree of a court exercising original jurisdiction under this Act (other than the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia). Note: In relation to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia, see sections 55 and 155 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021. (2) If, apart from this subsection, subsection (1) is to any extent inconsistent with section 73 of the Constitution, this Act has effect  Schedule 2  Further consequential amendments  Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021 No. 13, 2021 as if the words “, except by special leave of the High Court” were added at the end of subsection (1)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9124e79c9bca29d5c84876760cc1a635be8e336ec115bd2499f61c324c4a7850" ;
    cof:pageNumber "101"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-107-2-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-107-2-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
