concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-568 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "568 No limitation on powers of the Federal Circuit and Family"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-568 ;
    values:originalText "Court of Australia (Division 2) To avoid doubt, nothing in this Act limits the powers of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) under section 139, 140 or 141 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021." ;
    skos:definition "Court of Australia (Division 2) To avoid doubt, nothing in this Act limits the powers of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) under section 139, 140 or 141 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021."@en ;
