concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-490 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "490 At the end of section 5"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-490 ;
    values:originalText "Add: (3) To avoid doubt, a person may satisfy the definition of Judge at a particular time even if the person also holds, at the same time, an office as a Judge of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2). Note: See paragraph (a) of the definition of Judge in subsection 4(1).  Further consequential amendments  Schedule 2  No. 13, 2021 Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021 Judicial and Statutory Officers (Remuneration and Allowances) Act 1984" ;
    skos:definition "Add: (3) To avoid doubt, a person may satisfy the definition of Judge at a particular time even if the person also holds, at the same time, an office as a Judge of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2). Note: See paragraph (a) of the definition of Judge in subsection 4(1).  Further consequential amendments  Schedule 2  No. 13, 2021 Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021 Judicial and Statutory Officers (Remuneration and Allowances) Act 1984"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "981551ade21839575b9730e79e79e800451e1c12adb8ad795423ad81b0cf1ebe" ;
    cof:pageNumber "146"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "A person may satisfy the definition of Judge even if holding another office." ;
