concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-549 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "549 Paragraph 476A(1)(a)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-549 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute: (a) both: (i) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) transfers a proceeding pending in that court in relation to the decision to the Federal Court under section 153 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021; and (ii) the Federal Court confirms the transfer under section 32AD of the Federal Court of Australia Act 1976; or" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraph, substitute: (a) both: (i) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) transfers a proceeding pending in that court in relation to the decision to the Federal Court under section 153 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021; and (ii) the Federal Court confirms the transfer under section 32AD of the Federal Court of Australia Act 1976; or"@en ;
