concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-550 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "550 After subsection 476A(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-550 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: (1A) To avoid doubt, the Federal Court does not have original jurisdiction in relation to a migration decision under subsection (1)  Schedule 2  Further consequential amendments  Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021 No. 13, 2021 in respect of proceedings that are transferred to the Federal Court under section 32AC of the Federal Court of Australia Act 1976." ;
    skos:definition "Insert: (1A) To avoid doubt, the Federal Court does not have original jurisdiction in relation to a migration decision under subsection (1)  Schedule 2  Further consequential amendments  Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021 No. 13, 2021 in respect of proceedings that are transferred to the Federal Court under section 32AC of the Federal Court of Australia Act 1976."@en ;
