concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-586 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "586 Subsection 13AA(2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-586 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute: (2) In the case of an eligible Judge, subject to the Rules of Court made under Chapter 4 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021, the order may be enforced as if the order were an order of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2).  Further consequential amendments  Schedule 2  No. 13, 2021 Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute: (2) In the case of an eligible Judge, subject to the Rules of Court made under Chapter 4 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021, the order may be enforced as if the order were an order of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2).  Further consequential amendments  Schedule 2  No. 13, 2021 Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021"@en ;
