concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-610 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "610 Subsection 191(2) (note 2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-610 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the note, substitute: Note 2: For transfers from the Federal Court to the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2): see section 32AB of the Federal Court of Australia Act 1976. Note 3: For transfers from the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) to the Federal Court: see section 153 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021 and section 32AC of the Federal Court of Australia Act 1976." ;
