concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-671 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "671 Section 205"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-671 ;
    values:originalText "Omit: Jurisdiction is conferred on the Federal Court, the Federal Circuit Court, courts of States and Territories and the Family Court. PPS  Schedule 2  Further consequential amendments  Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021 No. 13, 2021 matters can be transferred between courts in accordance with procedures set out in this Part. substitute: Jurisdiction is conferred on the Federal Court, the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1), the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) and courts of States and Territories. PPS matters can be transferred between courts in accordance with procedures set out in this Part." ;
    skos:definition "Omit: Jurisdiction is conferred on the Federal Court, the Federal Circuit Court, courts of States and Territories and the Family Court. PPS  Schedule 2  Further consequential amendments  Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021 No. 13, 2021 matters can be transferred between courts in accordance with procedures set out in this Part. substitute: Jurisdiction is conferred on the Federal Court, the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1), the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) and courts of States and Territories. PPS matters can be transferred between courts in accordance with procedures set out in this Part."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "23644894f96cf02cc7bdb112540c67244620e4537d3ff02ebfee7fce0241cab6" ;
    cof:pageNumber "173"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Jurisdiction is conferred on specified courts." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
