the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1); (c) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2); (d) a court of a State; (e) a court of another Territory. a court of an external Territory (a) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1); (b) Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2); (c) a court of a State; (d) a court of another Territory (whether internal or external). a State Family Court (a) the Federal Court; (b) the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2); (c) the Supreme Court of the same State; (d) a court of another State; (e) a court of a Territory." ;
