concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-679 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "679 Subsection 210(2) (note 2)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-679 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the note, substitute: Note 2: Transfers mentioned in the table are covered by other legislation as follows: (a) for a transfer mentioned in item 1—section 32AC of the Federal Court of Australia Act 1976; (b) for a transfer mentioned in item 2—section 32AB of the Federal Court of Australia Act 1976; (c) for a transfer mentioned in item 3—section 52 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021; (d) for a transfer mentioned in item 4—sections 149 and 153 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021." ;
