    skos:prefLabel "693 Subsection 56A(5)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-693 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute: (5) Subsection (4) does not limit the power of the Chief Judge of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) to make Rules of Court under Chapter 4 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021 that are consistent with the regulations referred to in that subsection." ;
