concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-711 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "711 Section 9"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-711 ;
    values:originalText "Omit: The Federal Court or Federal Circuit Court may make orders for civil remedies (including compensation, injunctions and reinstatement of employment) if a reprisal is taken against a person because of a public interest disclosure (including a proposed or a suspected public interest disclosure). substitute: The Federal Court or Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) may make orders for civil remedies (including compensation, injunctions and reinstatement of employment) if a reprisal is taken against a person because of a public interest disclosure (including a proposed or a suspected public interest disclosure)." ;
    skos:definition "Omit: The Federal Court or Federal Circuit Court may make orders for civil remedies (including compensation, injunctions and reinstatement of employment) if a reprisal is taken against a person because of a public interest disclosure (including a proposed or a suspected public interest disclosure). substitute: The Federal Court or Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 2) may make orders for civil remedies (including compensation, injunctions and reinstatement of employment) if a reprisal is taken against a person because of a public interest disclosure (including a proposed or a suspected public interest disclosure)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f07b6230ed4e138907ca5d71a50dba0f90076c804ab4a6b929e47a8010f7d4b8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "182"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Federal Court or Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia may not make orders for civil remedies if a reprisal is taken against a person because of a public interest disclosure." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <c2021a00013rec01.pdf> ;
    dc:source "c2021a00013rec01.pdf, p.182" ;
    cml:asserts concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-2-sec-711-norm .
