concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-3-sec-11 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11 Certification of retired disabled Judges"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-11 ;
    values:originalText "A certification by the Minister under paragraph 9A(2)(a) of Schedule 1 to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Act 1999 before the commencement day that a person is a retired disabled Judge has effect, on and after that day, as if it were a certification by the Minister under section 122 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021 that the person is a retired disabled Judge." ;
    skos:definition "A certification by the Minister under paragraph 9A(2)(a) of Schedule 1 to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Act 1999 before the commencement day that a person is a retired disabled Judge has effect, on and after that day, as if it were a certification by the Minister under section 122 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021 that the person is a retired disabled Judge."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "eb8e1b8abd2f30a5b0537a6bc0da34d2083eb01a5d5e18394070634bb26a98b3" ;
    cof:pageNumber "201"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Certification of retired disabled Judges" ;
