concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-11 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11 Things done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or a Deputy"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-11 ;
    values:originalText "Marshal (1) If a thing was done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or a Deputy Marshal of the Family Court of Australia, then the thing is taken, for the purposes of the operation of any law on and after the commencement day, to have been done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or a Deputy Marshal of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1). (2) The Minister may, in writing, determine that subitem (1) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or a Deputy Marshal of the Family Court of Australia. (3) To avoid doubt, doing a thing includes making an instrument. (4) A determination under subitem (2) is not a legislative instrument.  Schedule 5  Transitional provisions" ;
    skos:definition "Marshal (1) If a thing was done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or a Deputy Marshal of the Family Court of Australia, then the thing is taken, for the purposes of the operation of any law on and after the commencement day, to have been done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or a Deputy Marshal of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1). (2) The Minister may, in writing, determine that subitem (1) does not apply in relation to a specified thing done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or a Deputy Marshal of the Family Court of Australia. (3) To avoid doubt, doing a thing includes making an instrument. (4) A determination under subitem (2) is not a legislative instrument.  Schedule 5  Transitional provisions"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "43a5fe3e501b7fd2bdc0791d3c1abfc33b71b1412de5f2c6e260fbb2a15c89b3" ;
    cof:pageNumber "219"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Things done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or a Deputy are taken as having been done by, or in relation to, the Marshal or a Deputy of the specified court." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
