doc:sch-5-sec-35 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "35 Application of case management provisions" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Division 4 of Part 5 of Chapter 3 of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021 (Case management) applies in relation to: (a) a proceeding commenced before the commencement day that will come before the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1) because of an item of this Part; and (b) a proceeding commencing on or after the commencement day that comes before the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Division 1) because of an item of this Part.  Transitional provisions  Schedule 5 Miscellaneous  Part 5 No. 13, 2021 Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia (Consequential Amendments and Transitional Provisions) Act 2021" ;
    cof:pageNumber "236"^^xsd:integer .

concept:c2021a00013rec01-sch-5-sec-36 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "36 Prior judicial service"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-36 ;
    values:originalText "Paragraph 123(3)(b) of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021 has effect, on and after the commencement day, as if paragraph (c) of the definition of prior judicial service in subsection 7(1) of that Act included a reference to a Federal Magistrate. Note: The appointment of a Federal Magistrate under the former Federal Magistrates Act 1999 continued as an appointment of a Judge of the Federal Circuit Court of Australia: see subitem 8(1) of Schedule 2 to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Legislation Amendment Act 2012. See also item 15 of this Schedule." ;
    skos:definition "Paragraph 123(3)(b) of the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021 has effect, on and after the commencement day, as if paragraph (c) of the definition of prior judicial service in subsection 7(1) of that Act included a reference to a Federal Magistrate. Note: The appointment of a Federal Magistrate under the former Federal Magistrates Act 1999 continued as an appointment of a Judge of the Federal Circuit Court of Australia: see subitem 8(1) of Schedule 2 to the Federal Circuit Court of Australia Legislation Amendment Act 2012. See also item 15 of this Schedule."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "e5b3b0209bfe61abb1b17ae40d50d3e637647cbefaa90fa99684fea7cbc6eab2" ;
    cof:pageNumber "237"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prior judicial service includes Federal Magistrate appointments" ;
