    cof:title "37 Application" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021, including the following provisions of that Act: (a) Division 4 of Part 5 of Chapter 3 (Case management); (b) Division 4 of Part 6 of Chapter 4 (Case management); applies in relation to a proceeding commenced before, on or after the commencement day." ;
